    "55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Walks just got easier",
            "text": "<p>I used to carry a separate bottle and a collapsible bowl every single time. Now it's one thing clipped to my belt loop and we're out the door.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Maya P.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Game-changer for hot days",
            "text": "<p>Took it on a four-hour hike last weekend and Cooper drank refill after refill. I would've felt awful without it.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Tomás L.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Looks as good as it works",
            "text": "<p>Half the reason I keep using it is that it doesn't look like every other plastic pet product. Clean, simple, premium.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Brooke A.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Worth every penny",
            "text": "<p>Bought this for our beagle and now my mom wants one for her terrier. Feels sturdy, doesn't feel cheap, and actually works the way it's supposed to.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Devon S.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-5": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Road-trip essential",
            "text": "<p>Took it up the coast last month and kept Bear hydrated at every stop. Lived in the cup holder, never spilled a drop.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Priya N.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Dog-approved",
            "text": "<p>Loki was suspicious at first but now he sprints over the second I pull it out of my bag. Total seal of approval.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Wes H.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Way more useful than I expected",
            "text": "<p>Honestly thought it was a nice-to-have. Three weeks in and I genuinely don't leave the house without it.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Hannah J.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-8": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Beach days, sorted",
            "text": "<p>Sand, saltwater, sun — handled all of it. Rinses clean and looks brand new every time we get home.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Marcus T.</strong></em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Best impulse buy this year",
            "text": "<p>Was on the fence about it. Three weeks in and it goes everywhere with me and Bailey. Just a really well-made product.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Erin V.<\\/strong><\\/em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-10": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Quality is unreal",
            "text": "<p>I've bought a dozen pet products that fell apart in a month. This one feels built to actually last. Stainless steel, clean welds, nothing flimsy.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Carlos M.<\\/strong><\\/em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-11": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "My pup loves it",
            "text": "<p>Maisie now associates the click of the clip with going outside. She lights up every time. That's all I needed to know.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Sam K.<\\/strong><\\/em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-12": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Solves a real problem",
            "text": "<p>Long walks in the summer used to mean cutting them short. Now we go further because I know I can give her water whenever.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Rachel D.<\\/strong><\\/em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-13": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Better than I expected",
            "text": "<p>Honestly thought the foldable bowl would feel cheap. Wrong. It's solid silicone and seals shut so well I can shake the bottle upside down with no leak.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Yusuf A.<\\/strong><\\/em>"
          }
        },
        "template--21507361800487__55bd100e-3bbd-426c-a5cf-eed7b2a3706f-column-14": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Worth it for the design alone",
            "text": "<p>Looks like something Aesop would sell. Matches my bag, doesn't scream 'pet product'. Bonus that it actually works.</p>",
            "author": "<em><strong>Lena F.<\\/strong><\\/em>"
          }
        }
      },
